</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">DEN OF NALORAKK · MYTHIC+ · ROGUE FIELD CARD</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">潜行者</span><span class="dot">·</span>纳洛拉克的洞穴 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">这个副本的大伤害是<b>全团物理和冰霜</b>，斗篷能顶的毒和魔法不多，所以要把它<b>留给纳洛拉克的回响重击</b>。其余几个大技能靠<b>副本给的东西</b>处理：压制强攻按防御姿态，寒冰暴雨站进雪堆，强风躲到掩体后面。佯攻全程常驻。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+24 限时敏锐贼 ×3</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>欺诈者</b></span>
      <span class="chip">适用 <b>斗篷 / 佯攻 / 闪避 / 消失 / 暗影步 三系通用</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里斗篷交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一整场 +24 里，暗影斗篷每次交给了谁。前两个首领和小怪段随手清减益，到纳洛拉克前把冷却转好。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
      <div class="tl">
        <div class="band trash" style="left:1.1%;width:13.7%">小怪 · 开场</div>
        <div class="band boss"  style="left:14.9%;width:14.1%">囤宝狂人</div>
        <div class="band trash" style="left:30%;width:24.8%">小怪 · 冰原</div>
        <div class="band boss"  style="left:55%;width:14.4%">寒冬哨兵</div>
        <div class="band trash" style="left:72.8%;width:13.2%">小怪 · 图腾</div>
        <div class="band boss"  style="left:86.1%;width:13.8%">纳洛拉克</div>

        <div class="axis" style="left:0;transform:none">0:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:18%">5:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:36%">10:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:54%">15:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:71.9%">20:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:89.9%">25:00</div>

        <div class="mk up" style="left:9.44%"><span class="lab">清苦难盛宴</span><span class="t">2:37</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk dn" style="left:20.1%"><span class="lab">清剧毒孢子</span><span class="t">5:35</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk up muted" style="left:22.96%"><span class="lab">闪避顶贪婪咆哮</span><span class="t">6:22</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:5277}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk dn" style="left:51.31%"><span class="lab">解冰川之墓</span><span class="t">14:15</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk up" style="left:90.52%"><span class="lab">免疫回响重击</span><span class="t">25:09</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk dn end" style="left:99.77%"><span class="lab">免疫回响重击</span><span class="t">27:44</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i style="background:rgba(242,210,75,.25);border:1px solid var(--gold-dim)"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i style="background:var(--panel-2);border:1px dashed var(--line)"></i>小怪段</span>
      <span><i style="background:var(--gold);border-radius:50%"></i>暗影斗篷</span>
      <span><i style="background:var(--faint);border-radius:50%"></i>闪避</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>先学这四招</h2>
  <p class="sub">每把都要做到的四件事，三件在后两个首领。</p>
  <div class="moments">
    <article class="mo">
      <div class="where">首领 3 · 纳洛拉克</div>
      <div class="sig">看到<b>自己被回响重击点名</b></div>
      <div class="act"><span class="arrow">→</span><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-imm">免疫</span></div>
      <p>点名有 4 秒，在这 4 秒里开。回响落地的自然伤害直接归零，不开要吃掉六成血。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="mo">
      <div class="where">首领 3 · 纳洛拉克</div>
      <div class="sig">看到<b>压制强攻起手</b></div>
      <div class="act"><span class="arrow">→</span><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1261781}}" alt="">防御姿态 <span class="pill p-dr">副本按钮</span></div>
      <p>连续 3 秒的无视护甲物理伤害，按了降低 80%。最后一下会把人击飞，落地后暗影步回首领。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="mo">
      <div class="where">首领 2 · 寒冬哨兵</div>
      <div class="sig">看到<b>寒冰暴雨读条</b></div>
      <div class="act"><span class="arrow">→</span><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1235841}}" alt="">站进雪堆 <span class="pill p-mv">免击退</span></div>
      <p>暴雨会把人往外推，被推出风暴之眼每秒多吃 14.5 万冰霜。雪堆里免疫强制位移，站住就不会被推出去。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="mo">
      <div class="where">首领 1 · 囤宝狂人</div>
      <div class="sig">看到<b>饕餮怒吼 / 贪婪咆哮读条</b></div>
      <div class="act"><span class="arrow">→</span><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
      <p>咆哮是全团物理加 10 秒流血。佯攻盖住首击；饕餮怒吼会把人震开，落地接暗影步回去继续打。</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>回响重击：点名 4 秒内开斗篷</h2>
  <div class="finding">
    <div>
      <h3><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1242869}}" alt="">回响重击 + 暗影斗篷</h3>
      <p>纳洛拉克会给几名玩家挂上<b>回响重击</b>标记，4 秒后在你脚下生成一个回响，<b>8 码内的人都吃一次自然伤害</b>。+24 一次大约是满血贼的六成，碰上和别的回响叠在一起能直接打穿。</p>
      <p>它是法术伤害，<b>暗影斗篷可以整段免疫</b>。标记一挂上就开，5 秒的斗篷正好盖住落地那一下。</p>
      <p>一场纳洛拉克大概 4 分钟，斗篷只够交两次，其余的标记用<b>闪避</b>：有天赋「飘忽不定」时闪避期间受到的所有伤害降低 20%。两样都在冷却时，至少保证佯攻在身上，并且走出队友 8 码再落地，别把回响叠在一起。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bars" role="img" aria-label="回响重击一次承伤：不处理约 68 万，开闪避约 56 万，开斗篷 0">
      <div class="cap">回响重击一次承伤（含吸收盾）</div>
      <div class="bar-row"><span>不处理</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">约 68 万</span></div></div>
      <div class="bar-row"><span>闪避</span><div class="bar"><span class="on dim" style="width:82%">约 56 万</span></div></div>
      <div class="bar-row"><span>暗影斗篷</span><div class="bar"><span class="zero">0 · 免疫</span></div></div>
      <div class="delta">0<small>斗篷开在点名期间</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">04</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">每一行：看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。</p>
  <div class="route">

    <div class="stop trash">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 囤宝狂人</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 第 1–3 波</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:6770}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">开怪前</div><div class="s">锐眼掠击鹰、地语看护者</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1784}}" alt="">潜行 + 闷棍 <span class="pill p-mv">控制</span></div>
          <div class="why">先闷掉一只，拉的时候少一个要处理的</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1238687}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">苦难盛宴</div><div class="s">饥渴之灵读条 <span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag magic">暗影</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-clr">自解</span></div>
          <div class="why">清掉 5 秒吸血 DoT，怪也少回血</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1238439}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">剃刀俯冲</div><div class="s">掠击鹰扑脸 <span class="tag">点名</span><span class="tag bleed">流血</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">「飘忽不定」让佯攻也减单体伤害</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297701}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">腐烂地面</div><div class="s">补给品砸出的毒地 <span class="tag">地面</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">瞬移到怪身后，不在地面上多站一秒</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">苦难盛宴是全团技能，斗篷只保自己。打断能断就断，断不到再交斗篷。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop boss">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>囤宝狂人</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1234681}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">贪婪咆哮</div><div class="s">咆哮读条 <span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag bleed">物理</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 / 闪避 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">佯攻顶首击，闪避靠天赋再减 20% 盖住流血</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235125}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">饕餮怒吼</div><div class="s">咆哮后被击退 <span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">落地立刻回到首领背后</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1234846}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">剧毒孢子</div><div class="s">蘑菇毒云叠层 <span class="tag poison">中毒</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-clr">自解</span></div>
          <div class="why">叠高了一次清空，省治疗一个驱散</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235405}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">骨刺扎入</div><div class="s">骨片地面 <span class="tag">减速</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1856}}" alt="">消失 / 疾跑 <span class="pill p-mv">解控</span></div>
          <div class="why">消失解掉 50% 减速，疾跑跑出骨片</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1234734}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">腐坏补给</div><div class="s">7 秒连续投掷 <span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">投掷期间保持佯攻在身上</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">这里的斗篷可以随手交，到纳洛拉克还有十几分钟，冷却来得及。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop trash">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>囤宝狂人 → 寒冬哨兵</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 第 5–8 波</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1241464}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">冰川之墓</div><div class="s">化身读条后全员冻住 <span class="tag">定身</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-clr">自解</span></div>
          <div class="why">自己先出冰墓，接着打别人的墓</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1252825}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">强风</div><div class="s">寒风把人往后推</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1233904}}" alt="">躲到掩体后 <span class="pill p-mv">副本</span></div>
          <div class="why">「受到掩护」期间不会被吹走</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1309919}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">冰冷咆哮</div><div class="s">熊吼 <span class="tag">减速</span><span class="tag">减急速</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1856}}" alt="">消失 <span class="pill p-mv">解控</span></div>
          <div class="why">解掉 50% 减速，跟得上拉怪</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1296519}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">隆隆结界</div><div class="s">奔行者护盾 1 分钟 <span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">每 2 秒一跳，佯攻一直续</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1239860}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">冰寒涌动</div><div class="s">亡魂点名 <span class="tag magic">魔法</span><span class="tag">4 码</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 + 散开 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">离队友 4 码，等奶骑驱散</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">冰川亡魂死后会留雪堆。雪堆里免疫击退，但移动速度降低 40%，打完这波就出来。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop boss">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>寒冬哨兵</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235658}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">寒冰暴雨</div><div class="s">风暴读条 <span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag">外推</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1235841}}" alt="">站进雪堆 <span class="pill p-mv">免击退</span></div>
          <div class="why">不被推出风暴之眼</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235658}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">寒冰暴雨</div><div class="s">附近没有雪堆</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-imm">免疫</span></div>
          <div class="why">5 秒内暴雨伤害打不进来</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235829}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">寒冬帷幕</div><div class="s">震颤核心 <span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag">易伤叠层</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 + 先杀核心 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">核心死了才有雪堆，也不再叠冰霜易伤</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235635}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">狂怒的飑风</div><div class="s">场上游荡 1.5 分钟 <span class="tag">地面</span><span class="tag">击退</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:2983}}" alt="">疾跑 / 暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">看着飑风走位，别贴着它打</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note warn"><b>注意：</b>飑风在寒冰暴雨期间最难看清，撞上一下能把满血的贼直接打死。暴雨时站雪堆，眼睛盯着飑风。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop trash">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>寒冬哨兵 → 纳洛拉克</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 第 10–11 波</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:6770}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">开怪前</div><div class="s">冷酷的图腾召唤者、刃牙山猫</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1784}}" alt="">潜行 + 闷棍 <span class="pill p-mv">控制</span></div>
          <div class="why">晚一点放图腾，少一只扑人的猫</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246957}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">原始回响</div><div class="s">战争使者 60 码 <span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag bleed">物理叠层</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">每次读条都开，叠层越往后越疼</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246825}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">灼热岩浆</div><div class="s">熔岩图腾喷射 <span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag magic">火焰</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-imm">免疫</span></div>
          <div class="why">和原始回响叠在一起时交，躲掉岩浆这一半</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247367}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">地震术</div><div class="s">纳尼亚点名地面 30 秒 <span class="tag">地面</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">瞬移出裂地，不用停手走路</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note warn"><b>注意：</b>这一段斗篷交了要算好时间：首领一开就有回响重击，斗篷最好在<b>进首领前转好</b>。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop boss">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>纳洛拉克</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1242869}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">回响重击</div><div class="s">被点名 4 秒 <span class="tag">点名</span><span class="tag">8 码</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-imm">免疫</span></div>
          <div class="why">落地伤害归零</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1242869}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">回响重击</div><div class="s">斗篷在冷却</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">「飘忽不定」减 20%，再走出队友 8 码</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297793}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">压制强攻</div><div class="s">3 秒连击 <span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag bleed">无视护甲</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1261781}}" alt="">防御姿态 <span class="pill p-dr">副本按钮</span></div>
          <div class="why">压制强攻伤害降低 80%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297793}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">压制强攻</div><div class="s">最后一击击退</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">落地马上回到首领身边</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297797}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">强力猛击</div><div class="s">砸向祖尔加拉 <span class="tag">6 码</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:2983}}" alt="">离开落点 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">留给坦克接，贼站进去必死</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">斗篷<b>只给回响重击</b>，一场交两次；中间的标记用闪避顶，别在压制强攻上把斗篷交掉，它是物理伤害，斗篷顶不到。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">05</span>工具箱</h2>
  <p class="sub">金框是这个副本的核心。</p>
  <div class="tools">
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">暗影斗篷</div><span class="pill p-imm">免疫 · 自解</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>回响重击、寒冰暴雨、灼热岩浆；清苦难盛宴、剧毒孢子、冰川之墓</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>纳洛拉克前转好，被点名就开</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1261781}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">防御姿态</div><span class="pill p-dr">副本按钮</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>压制强攻，伤害降低 80%</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>每次压制强攻起手</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1966}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">佯攻</div><span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>咆哮、腐坏补给、隆隆结界、原始回响、剃刀俯冲</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>几乎常驻，两层充能轮着用</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:5277}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">闪避</div><span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>回响重击（斗篷没好时）、贪婪咆哮的流血</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>点名或读条时开，靠天赋减伤</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1235841}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">雪堆（雪流）</div><span class="pill p-mv">副本 · 免击退</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>寒冰暴雨的外推</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>暴雨读条前站进去</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:36554}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">暗影步</div><span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>饕餮怒吼、压制强攻的击退；腐烂地面、地震术</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>被击飞落地后、踩到地面时</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1856}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">消失</div><span class="pill p-mv">解控</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>骨刺扎入、冰冷咆哮的减速</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>被减速后，顺手接输出</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:6770}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">闷棍</div><span class="pill p-mv">控制</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>锐眼掠击鹰、地语看护者、图腾召唤者、刃牙山猫</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>开怪前潜行摸上去</dd></dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">06</span>身上常中的减益</h2>
  <div class="tbl-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>减益</th><th>类型</th><th>自己能解吗</th><th>一般怎么处理</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1242869}}" alt="">回响重击</div></td><td><span class="tag">点名</span><span class="tag">8 码</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷免疫</td><td>斗篷没好就闪避，走出队友 8 码</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1238687}}" alt="">苦难盛宴</div></td><td><span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag magic">暗影</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷</td><td>打断饥渴之灵的读条</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1234846}}" alt="">剧毒孢子</div></td><td><span class="tag poison">中毒</span><span class="tag">叠层</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷</td><td>奶骑清洁术、萨满清毒</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1241464}}" alt="">冰川之墓</div></td><td><span class="tag">定身</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷</td><td>全队打碎冰墓，自由祝福</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1239860}}" alt="">冰寒涌动</div></td><td><span class="tag magic">魔法</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷 <span class="no">/ 一般不交</span></td><td>散开，奶骑清洁术</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1309919}}" alt="">冰冷咆哮</div></td><td><span class="tag">减速</span><span class="tag">减急速</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 消失解减速</td><td>萨满可以驱散</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1235405}}" alt="">骨刺扎入</div></td><td><span class="tag">地面</span><span class="tag">减速</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 消失解减速</td><td>离开骨片区域</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1238801}}" alt="">饥肠辘辘</div></td><td><span class="tag">诅咒</span><span class="tag">减最大生命</span></td><td class="no">✗</td><td>萨满净化灵魂，先杀图腾</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1238439}}" alt="">剃刀俯冲</div></td><td><span class="tag bleed">流血</span><span class="tag">叠层</span></td><td class="no">✗</td><td>佯攻减伤，奶骑保护祝福能清</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1246957}}" alt="">原始回响</div></td><td><span class="tag bleed">物理</span><span class="tag">叠层</span></td><td class="no">✗</td><td>佯攻顶，3 秒自己掉</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">07</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">+24 高手同款敏锐天赋，英雄天赋欺诈者。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{T:79008}}" alt=""><div><b>飘忽不定</b><span>闪避期间受到的伤害降低 20%，回响重击靠它顶；佯攻也减单体伤害</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{T:423647}}" alt=""><div><b>优雅诡谋</b><span>佯攻 2 次充能，这个副本全团技能多，几乎一直挂着</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{T:394931}}" alt=""><div><b>蹈厉奋发</b><span>暗影步多 1 次充能，两次击退都能马上回来</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{T:1267220}}" alt=""><div><b>危险感知</b><span>20% 几率让受到的伤害降低 20%</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{T:231719}}" alt=""><div><b>麻木神经</b><span>受到的物理伤害降低，压制强攻、咆哮都是物理</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{T:381637}}" alt=""><div><b>萎缩药膏</b><span>中毒的敌人造成的伤害降低</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{T:280716}}" alt=""><div><b>吸血药膏</b><span>致命药膏附带吸血</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{T:231691}}" alt=""><div><b>强化疾跑</b><span>疾跑冷却缩短，躲飑风更从容</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{T:378807}}" alt=""><div><b>暗影奔行者</b><span>潜行时移动速度提高 20%，摸过去闷棍更快</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{T:441247}}" alt=""><div><b>烟雾</b>（欺诈者）<span>惊慌的目标对你造成的伤害降低 5%</span></div></div>
    </div>
